OL,3,GNEWSACard glitch 'another deterrent' to
OL,4,Ausing Metro
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "glitch" in a railway payment card
OL,7,Fsystem that has prevented users topping
OL,8,Fup their accounts since Friday is "yet
OL,9,Fanother deterrent" to using local
OL,10,Ftrains, according to a passenger group.
OL,12,FSome people using Google Pay with Pop
OL,13,Fcards on the Tyne and Wear Metro have
OL,14,Fbeen unable to add funds and, in some
OL,15,Fcases, have seen money leave their
OL,16,Faccount but not register on cards.
OL,18,FNexus head of ICT Steve Duchar said it
OL,19,Fwas working with its supplier but he
OL,20,Fhad no date for when the errors would
OL,21,Fbe fixed.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
