OL,3,GNEWSACard glitch 'another deterrent' to
OL,4,Ausing Metro
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlistair Ford, of the North East Public
OL,7,FTransport Users Group, described Nexus'
OL,8,Fpay-and-go top-up system as
OL,9,Fold-fashioned and frustrating and
OL,10,Fcalled for "serious investment" to
OL,11,Fupdate payment systems.
